  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Water and Enviroment Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the program is to ensure the right to water for the rural population, supporting sustainable management of Uganda&apos;s water ressources and mainstreaming of climate change and adaptation. 800,000 additional people will get access to safe water.</narrative>
  </description>
